1 NOTE [hemmerdinger.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Death before 1761 is indicated by the pre-marital agreement of his son, Markus.  The source of the data given in this chart was from a letter from David Blum of NY in May, 1981, as well as a letter from Pierre Lautmann, Vincennes,
2 CONC  Frances on 11/9/95.  Marriage registration of Joseph and Judithe indicates that she is the daughter of David Cahen, Cantor in Metz.  The marriage contract between Judithe and Joseph is in the departmental archive of Metz (Moselle
2 CONC ) and is number 3E 3711/119.  According to an article of Denis Ingold extracted from "Jungholtz, Lieu de mémoire...", 2000,  Leman BLOCH of Soultz is cited as "guardian of the children of Joseph Hämendinger" in the Register of Aud
2 CONC iences of the Bailiff of Jungholtz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph's birth date and date of circumcision were found in the Mohelbuch
2 CONT of Dambach, a copy of which was obtained from the Central Archives for the History of the Jewish People in Jerusalem, and translated by David Blum of New York.  It states that Joseph ben HaRav Aron of Scherwiller was circumcised o
2 CONC n the 8 Nissan 5459.  This translates to Tuesday, April 7, 1699.   Counting backwards 8 days gives Tuesday,  March 31, 1699, as his day of birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1752 when Joseph's son, Benjamin, was married Joseph was living in Jungholtz.
