2 CONT Arrived in South Africa in 1836. He went to the Cape and in 1837 he settled in Graaff Reinet. Ten years later he began business in Bloemfontein. It was in his house that the first meeting of Free State Jews  took place on Yom Kipp
2 CONC ur 1871. He was twice Mayor of Bloemfontein. Baumann Square is named after him
2 CONT
