2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Mrs Leila Meyer (née Saks)
2 CONT Titanic Survivor
2 CONT Born: Tuesday 28th September 1886 in Baltimore, Maryland, United States 
2 CONT Age: 25 years 6 months and 17 days (Female)
2 CONT Nationality: American
2 CONT Marital Status: Married to Edgar Joseph Meyer
2 CONT Last Residence: in New York City, New York, United States
2 CONT 1st Class Passengers
2 CONT Embarked: Cherbourg on Wednesday 10th April 1912
2 CONT Ticket No. 17604, £82 3s 5d 
2 CONT Rescued (boat 6)  
2 CONT Disembarked Carpathia: New York City on Thursday 18th April 1912
2 CONT Died: Wednesday 27th November 1957 aged 71 years
2 CONT Buried: Salem Fields Cemetery, New York City, New York, United States
