2 CONT Abraham was an inkeeper in Colmar.  He is listed in the 1784 Denombrement in Hatstatt (family 20) as "Maitre d'ecole."  Breunle was the daughter of Salomon ben Elchanan of Hattstatt according to the letter of David Blum, Nov. 18, 
2 CONC 1991.
