1 NOTE [hemmerdinger.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Information taken from the name change list, 1808, Scherwiller and marriage registration of Aron and Nentel.  Aron appears in 1784 census with his first wife, in family 12.  From the death registration of his father, Isaac, it is 
2 CONC apparent that he began using the name "Aron Isaac" prior to formally adopting it in 1808.  Nentel's parents are given as Rabbi Samuel Hemmerdinger and Eva Marx of Fegersheim.  However, it is obvious from her date and place of birt
2 CONC h that her natural mother was Keyle Picard, the first wife of R. Samuel Hemmerdinger.  Her death registration from Fegersheim shows that she was born in Zillisheim and gives her name as "Catherine."
