2 CONT
2 CONT     * Birmingham, Stephen (1996), "Our Crowd": The Great Jewish Families of New York, Syracuse University Press, ISBN 978-0-8156-0411-2, http://books.google.com/books?id=xcaIrpV5gZAC&printsec=frontcover 
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Korn, Bertram (2001), American Jewry and the Civil War, Jewish Publications Society, ISBN 978-0-8276-0738-5 
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Marcus, Jacob Rader (1993), United States Jewry, 1776-1985: Volume III - The Germanic Period Part 2, Wayne State University Press, ISBN 978-0-8143-2188-1, http://books.google.com/books?id=O68mqWxeDl8C&printsec=frontcover 
2 CONT
