1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Alexander I found listed as a boy in Alsace (1784) with his siblings and widowed STEPMOTHER.  She married in 1797 Wolf Mock in Breisach"
2 CONT
2 CONT Many family details about the interconnected Salomon family whose seat was in a town across the Rhine (Parnas Family)"
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander's stepmother became later his Aunt, Herz Mock was an older cousin, whose daughter became Alexander's wife."
