2 CONC scher Friedhof Schopfloch; citing record ID 20650738, Find a Grave, http://www.findagrave.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT teacher and cantor in Wittelshofen
2 CONT
2 CONT born 10 May 1819 in Sulzbuerg
2 CONT
2 CONT died 03 Mar 1868 in Wittelshofen
2 CONT
2 CONT husband of Luise nee Baiersdorfer (born in Sulzbuerg)
2 CONT
2 CONT memorial text:
2 CONT
2 CONT Dieses Denkmal wurde dem unvergesslichen Vater von den Kindern in dankbarer Ergebenheit im Jahre 1900 neu errichtet.
2 CONT
2 CONT English translation:
2 CONT
2 CONT this monument was renewed in 1900 for the unforgettable father by the children in grateful submissiveness
2 CONT
2 CONT Children are known as Sara (died in Koeln), Berta (married in Munich, died 1938), Rosa (married in Frankfurt/Main), Marie (married in Munich) plus a son Simon a son David Lowenmayer (28 Feb 1853 Wittelshofen - 13 Feb 1939 Haar nea
2 CONC r Munich) lived in Munich since 1906
