1 NAME André-Armand /Durkheim/
2 GIVN André-Armand
2 _MARNM Durkheim
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 18 SEP 1892
2 PLAC 10th arrondissement
2 ADDR
3 CITY Paris
3 STAE Île-de-France
3 CTRY France
