2 CONT born on the 18th February 1893
2 CONT in Oberlahnstein/Sankt Goarshausen/Hessen-Nassau
2 CONT
2 CONT residing in Oberlahnstein
2 CONT
2 CONT INTERNMENT/ARREST
2 CONT bis 21st June 1944, Wien, Gefängnis
2 CONT DATE OF DEATH
2 CONT 21st June 1944
2 CONT PLACE OF DEATH
2 CONT Wien (Österreich)
