1 CONT Death before 1761 is indicated by the pre-marital agreement ofhis son,  Markus.  The source of the data given in this chartwas from a letter  from David Blum of NY in May, 1981, as wellas a letter from Pierre  Lautmann, Vincennes,
1 CONC  Frances on11/9/95.  Marriage registration of Joseph  and Judithe indicatesthat she is the daughter of David Cahen, Cantor in  Metz.  Themarriage contract between Judithe and Joseph is in thedepartmental archive of Metz (Moselle) 
1 CONC and is number 3E3711/119.
1 CONT
1 CONT Joseph's birth date and date of circumcision were found in theMohelbuch
1 CONT of Dambach, a copy of which was obtained from the CentralArchives for  the History of the Jewish People in Jerusalem, andtranslated by David  Blum of New York.  It states that Josephben Rav Aron of Scherwiller was  circumcised on 
1 CONC the 8 Nissan5459.  This translates to Tuesday, April 7,  1699.   Countingbackwards 8 days gives Tuesday,  March 31, 1699, as his  day ofbirth.
1 CONT
1 CONT In 1752 when Joseph's son, Benjamin, was married Joseph wasliving in  Jungholtz.
0 @N6000000002764534735@ NOTE
1 CONT Death before 1761 is indicated by the pre-marital agreement ofhis son,  Markus.  The source of the data given in this chartwas from a letter  from David Blum of NY in May, 1981, as wellas a letter from Pierre  Lautmann, Vincennes,
1 CONC  Frances on11/9/95.  Marriage registration of Joseph  and Judithe indicatesthat she is the daughter of David Cahen, Cantor in  Metz.  Themarriage contract between Judithe and Joseph is in thedepartmental archive of Metz (Moselle) 
1 CONC and is number 3E3711/119.
1 CONT
1 CONT Joseph's birth date and date of circumcision were found in theMohelbuch
1 CONT of Dambach, a copy of which was obtained from the CentralArchives for  the History of the Jewish People in Jerusalem, andtranslated by David  Blum of New York.  It states that Josephben Rav Aron of Scherwiller was  circumcised on 
1 CONC the 8 Nissan5459.  This translates to Tuesday, April 7,  1699.   Countingbackwards 8 days gives Tuesday,  March 31, 1699, as his  day ofbirth.
1 CONT
1 CONT In 1752 when Joseph's son, Benjamin, was married Joseph wasliving in  Jungholtz.
