1 CONT Information taken from the name change list, 1808, Scherwillerand  marriage registration of Aron and Nentel.  Aron appears in1784 census  with his first wife, in family 12.  From the deathregistration of his  father, Isaac, it is 
1 CONC apparent that he beganusing the name "Aron Isaac"  prior to formally adopting it in1808.  Nentel's parents are given as  Rabbi Samuel Hemmerdingerand Eva Marx of Fegersheim.  However, it is  obvious from herdate and place of birth
1 CONC  that her natural mother was  KeylePicard, the first wife of R. Samuel Hemmerdinger.  Her deathregistration from Fegersheim shows that she was born inZillisheim and  gives her name as "Catherine."
